"points>`__, if closer. The home location is where the vehicle was last armed"
" (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the vehicle configuration "
"allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*，或返回最近的 `集结点 <common-rally-points>`__ （如果更近）。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:653
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:655
#: 2d2e69d791f142bb93d7563718a9bfa5 a30bcecb64b74758a681fc324f2b5a9a
msgid "Copter"
msgstr "Copter"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:655
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:657
#: 58ce43c357724c2cbd7038e898bda366 7c9eff32b56846979f860850cb4eab44
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` if closer) and then land. The home location is where the "
"vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock after arming if the "
"vehicle configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 位置*（或最近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`，如果更近），然后降落。Home "
"位置是飞行器最后一次解锁的位置（如果飞行器配置允许，则为解锁后首次获得 GPS 锁定的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:659
#: 70f926754035486bbe2717e3f65a3c9d
msgid ""
"This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`RTL flight mode <copter:rtl-"
"mode>`.  The vehicle will first climb to the :ref:`RTL_ALT <copter:RTL_ALT>`"
" parameter's specified altitude (default is 15m) before returning home."
msgstr ""
"此指令等同于 :ref:`RTL 飞行模式 <copter:rtl-mode>`。飞行器将先爬升至 :ref:`RTL_ALT "
"<copter:RTL_ALT>` 参数指定的高度（默认为 15m），然后返回 Home。"

