msgid ""
"Fly to the target location using a `Spline path "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__, then wait "
"(hover) for a specified time before proceeding to the next command."
msgstr ""
"使用 `样条曲线路径 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spline_%28mathematics%29>`__ "
"飞往目标位置，然后等待（悬停）指定时间后继续执行下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:826
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:828
#: b7205191a8fc4711a077a416f805f449 c8bc4bc6b1bd4e34a2108e26c27e23e4
msgid ""
"The Spline commands take all the same arguments are regular waypoints (lat, "
"lon, alt, delay) but when executed the vehicle will fly smooth paths (both "
"vertically and horizontally) instead of straight lines. Spline waypoints can"
" be mixed with regular straight-line waypoints as shown in the screenshot "
"below."
msgstr ""
"样条指令与普通航点使用相同的参数（纬度、经度、高度、延迟），但执行时飞行器将沿平滑路径飞行（垂直和水平方向均如此），而非沿直线飞行。样条航点可与普通直线航点混用，如下方截图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:884
