msgid ""
"See also :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS <mav_cmd_do_guided_limits>` for "
"information on how to apply time, altitude and distance limits on the "
"external control."
msgstr ""
"另请参阅 :ref:`MAV_CMD_DO_GUIDED_LIMITS "
