#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:245
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:247
#: 5d16fdf26c5d4139999d62e820475514 bdaa82b622bc4bd985423b3ce476ee71
msgid ""
"The vehicle will fly to the specified latitude, longitude and altitude. The "
"waypoint is considered \"complete\" when Plane is within the specified "
"radius of the target location, at which point Plane processes the next "
"command."
msgstr "飞行器将飞往指定的纬度、经度和高度。当 Plane 位于目标位置的指定半径内时，航点被视为「完成」，Plane 随后处理下一个命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:250
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:252
#: 72ab55319f544ceba769c90bcad835a3 d744de2a8d4d44e59048545f0a2cb1a4
msgid ""
"The protocol additionally provides for the plane to circle the waypoint with"
" a specified radius and direction for a specified time (Delay). These "
"parameters are not supported by Copter."
msgstr "该协议还允许飞机以指定的半径和方向绕航点盘旋指定时间（延迟）。这些参数在 Copter 上不受支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:324
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:326
#: 24dd34d66f2e4f388945580be9539a43 cd22b639d97446c6a30e24d4aada33b1
msgid ""
"The plane climbs to the specified altitude (at the specified pitch/climb "
"angle) before proceeding to the next waypoint."
msgstr "飞机爬升到指定高度（以指定的俯仰/爬升角度）后再继续前往下一个航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:327
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:329
#: 968c0628aa7a4449b21eefec0a9ef866 d8dd5779d8c04163bdda00ede3ed461f
msgid ""
"The plane is *only* attempting to climb at this point and can be pushed off "
"its heading by wind. The pitch value is the *minimum* climb angle when using"
" an airspeed sensor, and *maximum* angle when **not** using an airspeed "
"sensor."
msgstr "此时飞机*仅*尝试爬升，可能被风吹偏离航向。俯仰值是使用空速传感器时的*最小*爬升角，以及 **不** 使用空速传感器时的*最大*角度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:383
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:385
#: 8c66214ba42441c4b31678506da796d3 f0195f787e254b978e5cc90248062723
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:385
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:387
#: 2da0a813aadc4ebb98c9b32f7b9bd133 f5f96a88f8f446a291bb5b20b61d3e34
msgid "Supported by:  Plane  (not Copter or Rover). Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:387
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:389
#: 403b56a731694c88b2581fcbb4ede59d b138bc00a67c41dda7abf7866586e978
msgid "Takeoff while in VTOL mode."
msgstr "在 VTOL 模式下起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:389
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:391
#: 37d9322c633449d4873dc961ddda2f59 5fe8634cf6f74b1a9c8baa0ba206eb9b
msgid ""
"The vehicle will climb straight up from it’s current location to the "
"specified altitude as a delta above its current altitude."
msgstr "飞行器将从当前位置垂直爬升到指定高度，该高度为当前高度之上的增量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:392
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:394
#: 100f436908994622a8798fbd4d75bf27 2baad98135e74ad3b2651a9d874ab4a7
msgid ""
"However, if :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 3 is set (use altitude reference"
" frames for VTOL takeoff), then the altitude value (in the specified "
"reference frame) will be used for the target altitude, instead of a delta "
"above the current altitude. If the command is begun while the vehicle is "
"already flying, the vehicle will climb straight up to the specified "
"altitude, if the vehicle is already above the altitude the command will be "
"ignored and the mission will move on to the next command immediately."
msgstr ""
"但是，如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 3 被置位（使用高度参考坐标系进行 VTOL "
"起飞），则该高度值（在指定参考坐标系下）会作为目标高度使用，而不是相对当前高度的增量。如果指令开始时载具已在飞行中，载具将直接爬升到指定高度；如果载具已经高于该高度，指令将被忽略，任务立即进入下一条指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:464
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:466
#: 0a1116a16c6147feaa9f16813548a303 76d613f9a4eb4f6aa0a265bd489b9f59
msgid ""
"Fly to the specified location and then loiter there indefinitely — where "
"loiter means \"circle the waypoint\". If zero is specified for a "
"latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current location value for "
"the parameter will be used. You can also specify the radius and direction "
"for the loiter."
msgstr ""
"飞到指定位置并在那里无限期 Loiter——这里的 Loiter 指「绕航点盘旋」。若纬度/经度/高度任一参数指定为 "
"0，则使用当前位置作为该参数的值。也可指定盘旋半径与方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:545
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:547
#: 17bffd2efc8a42bcab769a593b807aa0 18eab72955674316a015729c2891c494
msgid ""
"The radius of the circle is controlled by the command parameter. A radius of"
" 0 will result in :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` being used as the "
"radius. Negative radius values result in counter-clockwise turns instead of "
"clockwise turns. Radius values over 255 meters will be rounded down to the "
"nearest 10 meter mark. Once the number of turns is completed, continue to "
"loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param "
"=1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers. =1."
msgstr ""
"盘旋半径由指令参数控制。半径为 0 时将使用 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD<WP_LOITER_RAD>` "
"作为半径。负值半径表示逆时针盘旋（而非顺时针）。超过 255 米的半径会向下取整到最近的 10 米刻度。盘旋指定圈数后，会继续 Loiter "
"直到机头朝向下一个导航航点。若 XTrack Tangent 参数 = 1，则直接前往下一航点；否则沿两航点中心连线进入下一段轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:612
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:614
#: 02e8bb2394b84972b952ae57d28df784 fdc877e18faa46258d332103d7983696
msgid ""
"Fly to the specified location and then loiter there for the specified number"
" of seconds — where loiter means \"circle the waypoint\". The timer starts "
"when the waypoint is reached; when it expires the waypoint is complete. If "
"zero is specified for a latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the "
"current location value for the parameter will be used. You can also specify "
"the radius and direction for the loiter. Once time has elapsed, continue to "
"loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param = "
"gb1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers."
msgstr ""
"飞到指定位置并在那里 Loiter 指定的秒数——这里的 Loiter "
"指「绕航点盘旋」。计时器在到达航点时开始；到时后该航点完成。若纬度/经度/高度任一参数指定为 "
"0，则使用当前位置作为该参数的值。也可指定盘旋半径与方向。计时结束后，会继续 Loiter 直到机头朝向下一个导航航点。若 XTrack Tangent"
" 参数 = 1，则直接前往下一航点；否则沿两航点中心连线进入下一段轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:623
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:625
#: 3f1859bcde7449ba85d088924e178756 d69e42ca4a714fa6908ffda7bdc8aff5
msgid "The radius of the loiter is set in the ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` parameter."
msgstr "盘旋半径在 ``WP_LOITER_RAD`` 参数中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:691
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:693
#: b8f10feb784d4b3696dca20de6abaf8a cc109cd0f9664ba892fd497291ae7252
msgid ""
"Return to the *home location* (or the nearest :ref:`Rally Point <common-"
"rally-points>` if closer) and then \"Loiter\" (circle the point). The home "
"location is where the vehicle was last armed (or when it first gets GPS lock"
" after arming if the vehicle configuration allows this)."
msgstr ""
"返回 *Home 点*（或更近的 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>`），然后在该点上方 Loiter（绕点盘旋）。Home"
" 点是载具上次解锁的位置（或在配置允许时为解锁后首次获得 GPS 定位的位置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:696
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:698
#: 23af02d4595c437997647bfc5a8dcbe6 274a42a5ee80496bbd0af10b7b7b5ae9
msgid ""
"If the return is to a rally point, the plane will loiter at the position and"
" altitude set in the rally point. If the return is to the home location, "
"then the parameter :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` is used for the loiter"
" height (default 100m). The radius of the loiter is defined in the parameter"
" :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>`."
msgstr ""
"如果返回到集结点，飞机将在集结点设置的位置和高度盘旋。如果返回到 Home 位置，则使用参数 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE "
"<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 作为盘旋高度（默认 100m）。盘旋半径在参数 :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>`"
" 中定义。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:773
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:775
#: 18c373fba33e42a4adc56f1847852dbf e280cb7d024e421b94dca07d4f3fdd44
msgid ""
"The plane will land at its current location or proceed to the (non-zero) "
"lat/lon coordinates provided beginning with current altitude.  Information "
"on the parameters used to control the landing is provided in :ref:`LAND "
"flight mode <land-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"Plane 将在当前位置降落，或从当前高度飞到（非零）经纬度坐标后开始降落。控制降落的相关参数说明请参见 :ref:`LAND 飞行模式 <land-"
"mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:829
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:831
#: 19935759b3804b6782f2aa9f63086edb 9d0a60ee92a14b93b8ed166f60af5964
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_LAND"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_VTOL_LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:831
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:833
#: 96dc9351739f4358994990f2bad28b29 e6820114e6bd438ab52758d11ffd1bae
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover). Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:833
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:835
#: bc0a6c4edc5f4739bacba11b9381f8b2 fb5f1f0a076a4bc8bb73eeb95083270e
msgid "Land the vehicle at the current or a specified location."
msgstr "在当前或指定位置降落飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:835
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:837
#: 44f24403830b4ec2aabda4b71a804617 a7beb6c2276942f3ada5a16f45ce13f8
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is not set (default),the vehicle "
"will land at its current location or proceed at the current altitude to the "
"lat/lon coordinates provided (if non-zero) and land. The ALT parameter is "
"used to determine final landing phase initiation rather than "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>`. This is the mission equivalent of"
" the :ref:`QLAND flight mode <qland-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位 4 "
"未置位（默认），载具将在当前位置降落，或保持当前高度飞到所提供的（非零）经纬度坐标后再降落。ALT 参数用于决定何时进入最终降落阶段，取代了 "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 的作用。该指令是 :ref:`QLAND 飞行模式 <qland-"
"mode>` 的任务版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:838
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:840
#: 006f0300c2f44f519c56d5c521c2003d a9acbe950b994ebb9f50f0d6a3792ef8
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 is set (Use a fixed wind spiral "
"approach), the it will fly in plane mode to the lat/lon coordinates provided"
" (if non-zero), climbing or descending to the altitude set in the "
"NAV_VTOL_LAND waypoint. When it reaches within "
":ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` of the landing location, it will "
"perform a LOITER_TO_ALT to finish the climb or descent to that ALT set in "
"the waypoint, then, turning into the wind, transition to VTOL mode and "
"proceed to the landing location and land."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 4 "
"位被设置（使用固定翼螺旋进近），它将以固定翼模式飞向提供的纬经度坐标（如果非零），爬升或下降到 NAV_VTOL_LAND "
"航点中设置的高度。当到达距降落位置 :ref:`Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD<Q_FW_LND_APR_RAD>` 以内时，将执行 "
"LOITER_TO_ALT 以完成爬升或下降到航点中设置的该高度，然后迎风转向，过渡到 VTOL 模式并前往降落位置降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:840
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:842
#: 7e013c34efd84c14ac74283f740a37d1 cb890964213f4985b5966f4f9a8173b5
msgid "The motors will disarm on their own once landed"
msgstr "降落后电机将自动上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:842
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:844
#: 760f965e573a44149c69348350545179 d6cb5da35714461cae6f6641f7ebc0fb
msgid ""
"param1 of the command acts just like :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 4 "
"above, if that option bit is not set. This allows the use of different "
"approaches for different VTOL_LAND commands within the same mission."
msgstr ""
"如果该选项位未设置，命令的 param1 行为就像上述 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 4 位一样。这允许在同一任务中的不同"
" VTOL_LAND 命令使用不同的进近方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:901
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:903
#: 8f4b15a4a0b9470a9473c00e2d53e3e3 d2aa2f7277f345dabb94635a0cd0275e
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_CONTINUE_AND_CHANGE_ALT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2098
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2103
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:903
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:905
#: 2f27995c686f4be4af3886d6df429e5d 421804ce36bf48c09b964197208d17c8
#: 912e6720b061436ba11540c86e836ce4 ded22c5b5b6644ebba96415a76ca0e2d
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter, Rover)."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter、Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:905
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:907
#: 0fdbf55ac7ef42168ef2de4063e2baac 399641c78170486b9bb89a17363f0a13
msgid ""
"Continue on the current course and climb/descend to a specified altitude. "
"Move to the next command when the desired altitude is reached."
msgstr "继续当前航向并爬升/下降到指定高度。当到达所需高度时移至下一个命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:910
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:912
#: 0d48afbda62c4de189338f7157d5bf10 4e0e6492b8ed44afaf96798a59b08b49
msgid ""
"The ``param1`` value sets how close the vehicle altitude must be to target "
"altitude for command completion."
msgstr "``param1`` 值设置飞行器高度与目标高度的接近程度，以完成命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:978
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:983
#: 6512728d564e417a8d8e8597742776f6 bc1963be87c04904aaab9856a0af31d2
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_ALTITUDE_WAIT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_ALTITUDE_WAIT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1044
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1049
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2796
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2805
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2866
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2875
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2924
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2933
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:980
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:985
#: 43f4971ead4d49a7be1f12b803554c2b 4f271fe849304044b5e8336407535549
#: 63623ef771b74e139971421053d0f371 6d819410b31248189096463313f689a8
#: 6e38737014884745aeb0985b1c3e5305 72b11ed1694b49369d50fa526f8609f9
#: 88cbab671f464a52bae71ba081b5c1ed a5b0d128a7834ea48e8e21e2cc248c6c
#: b9f5f791e92243e8b78df4ebc0fc9921 c0185fe1d9fb42f299c91b30b15b0efd
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover)."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:982
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:987
#: 3d8803b21e764a3da5bc8e619ce5f185 fb98a8307517409cba7997b0ad6a2bf0
msgid ""
"Mission command to wait for an altitude or downward vertical speed. This is "
"meant for high-altitude balloon launches, allowing the aircraft to be idle "
"until either an altitude is reached or a negative vertical speed is reached "
"(indicating early balloon burst). The wiggle time is how often to wiggle the"
" control surfaces to prevent them from seizing up."
msgstr ""
"任务命令，等待到达某高度或向下垂直速度。这用于高空气球发射，允许飞机保持待机，直到到达某高度或达到负垂直速度（表示气球提前破裂）。摆动时间是多久摆动一次控制面以防止它们因长时间静止而卡死。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1042
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1047
#: 589f8fd87ee642beaff4b0831a92b562 598f294eb7f14d56bf2e9628735e2699
msgid "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_NAV_LOITER_TO_ALT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1046
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1051
#: 70866c576e5346469646bcea9b1ac509 9f8a0b5283a04019832c9d0ae74ffd07
msgid "Loiter while climbing/descending to an altitude."
msgstr "在爬升/下降至某高度时盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1048
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1053
#: 3e21b3509a4b464cb48c68ec38c96b6f 62d031d55f1841429bb6e7555042ba05
msgid ""
"Begin loitering at the specified Latitude and Longitude. If Lat=Lon=0, then "
"loiter at the current position. Don't consider the navigation command "
"complete (don't leave loiter) until the altitude has been reached. Continue "
"to loiter until heading points to next nav waypoint. If XTrack Tangent param"
" =1, proceed directly to next waypoint, otherwise, track to the path in a "
"line between the waypoint centers."
msgstr ""
"在指定纬度和经度开始盘旋。如果纬度=经度=0，则在当前位置盘旋。在到达高度之前不认为导航命令完成（不离开盘旋），继续盘旋直到航向指向下一个导航航点。如果"
" XTrack 切线参数=1，直接前往下一个航点，否则沿航点中心之间的线路追踪路径。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1118
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1123
#: 56e92a130d944a8d895f5769ab330179 f9fc3aaeb79046b2a851764d01bb827d
msgid ""
"After reaching this waypoint, if disarmed, delay the execution of the next "
"mission command until the time in seconds has elapsed. This is used in a "
"mission to allow a vehicle to land, disarm for a period (for a payload "
"change for example), and then re-arm, and takeoff to resume the mission. If "
"not disarmed, this mission item is skipped."
msgstr ""
"到达此航点后，如果已解锁，则延迟执行下一个任务命令，直到指定秒数过去。这用于任务中允许飞行器降落、解锁一段时间（例如用于更换载荷），然后重新解锁、起飞继续任务。如果未解锁，则跳过此任务项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1183
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1188
#: 00af9dac833d4d51b4a2df4a48da3f1c 77859a97b492498381169636e4946b63
msgid ""
"**QUADPLANE ONLY, fixed wing planes will skip this command** After reaching "
"this waypoint, the vehicle will have transitioned to VTOL and will descend "
"up to the maximum descent value. If the vehicle has not touched the ground "
"before this limit is reached, the vehicle will climb back up to the waypoint"
" altitude and continue to the next mission item. If it reaches the ground, "
"it will stop its motors and wait for a LUA script command (see `Package "
"Place LUA applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_package_place.lua>`__"
" ) to send an abort_landing command to ascend back to the waypoint altitude "
"and continue to the next mission item, be sent a disarm command, or the "
"pilot uses the ``RCx_OPTION`` = 173 to send the abort_landing command, "
"instead of via a LUA script. This allows the gripper to be commanded to be "
"released, packages replaced, etc."
msgstr ""
"**仅适用于四旋翼飞机，固定翼飞机将跳过此命令** 到达此航点后，飞行器将过渡到 VTOL "
"并下降至最大下降值。如果飞行器在达到此限制之前未触地，飞行器将爬回至航点高度并继续前往下一个任务项。如果它接触地面，将停止电机并等待 LUA "
"脚本命令（见 `包裹放置 LUA 小程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/plane_package_place.lua>`__）发送中止降落命令以上升回航点高度并继续前往下一个任务项，或发送解锁命令，或飞手使用"
" ``RCx_OPTION`` = 173 发送中止降落命令而非通过 LUA 脚本。这允许命令释放夹持器、更换包裹等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1662
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1667
#: 15e88cc85734405f9db4d8069461e524 70d4d3e08e6841889afd96f9fbb085b4
msgid ""
"Change the target horizontal speed (airspeed or groundspeed) and/or the "
"vehicle's throttle. If the airspeed option is selected, this changes the "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` parameter during the flight until "
"reboot or mode is changed to CRUISE or FBWB. If the groundspeed option is "
"used, then :ref:`MIN_GROUNDSPEED<MIN_GROUNDSPEED>` parameter is changed to "
"this value until rebooted or changed by this command again. If the throttle "
"field is non-zero and equal to or below 100, then the "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` parameter is changed  until reboot or "
"changed by this command again."
msgstr ""
"改变目标水平速度（空速或地速）和/或飞行器油门。如果选择了空速选项，这将在飞行中更改 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 参数，直到重启或模式更改为 Cruise 或 "
"FBWB。如果使用地速选项，则 :ref:`MIN_GROUNDSPEED<MIN_GROUNDSPEED>` "
"参数将更改为此值，直到重启或再次由此命令更改。如果油门字段非零且等于或低于 100，则 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 参数将更改，直到重启或再次由此命令更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1665
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1670
#: 31b315f5958542249b686abd2a21c9dc f2fea25f36b04511b01a43fc66e7f547
msgid ""
"Speed changes only have an effect if an airspeed sensor is present, healthy,"
" and in use. :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` changes impacts only flight"
" with airspeed sensor not in use."
msgstr ""
"速度变化仅在空速传感器存在、健康且正在使用时才有效。:ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"的变化仅影响未使用空速传感器的飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2096
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2101
#: 600ba3371c9448c79fa5ef2802ed4bf4 ffba7c0c04a64a7d97ca649d1e71bff8
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_LAND_START"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_LAND_START"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2100
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2105
#: 8351f812d3b0492ca78c67ab7a2a097c a872907797bf487f87f9ca063d665281
msgid "Mission command to prepare for a landing."
msgstr "用于准备降落的任务指令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2102
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2107
#: 3717a64e8c1846a1bceaa78fc30e329e f9c800b2808e4a57af740d6b90001df9
msgid ""
"This is used as a marker in a mission to tell the autopilot where a sequence"
" of mission items that represents a landing starts. It may also be sent via "
"a ``COMMAND_LONG`` to trigger a landing, in which case the nearest "
"(geographically) landing sequence in the mission will be used."
msgstr ""
"这用于在任务中标记一系列表示降落开始的任务项。它也可以通过 ``COMMAND_LONG`` "
"发送以触发降落，在这种情况下将使用任务中最近（地理上）的降落序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2107
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2112
#: 0d6792494ee64adda9c5ba0ced4730f5 9e231aad26d3475da803214f68f3322e
msgid ""
"If ``RTL_AUTOLAND`` is set to 2, the plane will jump to the nearest "
"``DO_LAND_START`` in the mission table when RTL is initialized."
msgstr "如果 ``RTL_AUTOLAND`` 设置为 2，当初始化 RTL 时，飞机将跳转到任务表中最近的 ``DO_LAND_START``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2112
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2117
#: 6c03b8ab36994617835b495c4aea7ea0 d1fc6fab48e44809b107d117eca54182
msgid ""
"General information on landing a plane is provided in the topic "
":ref:`Automatic Landing <automatic-landing>`."
msgstr "有关降落飞机的一般信息请参阅 :ref:`自动降落 <automatic-landing>` 主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2167
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2172
#: 6ef732ec383640fb9b41be2868af88ee 85cfc322965c44bab9e3ad84bd5fee99
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_VTOL_TRANSITION"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_VTOL_TRANSITION"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2169
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2174
#: 869af2e9ab7e4d47aeacca9e7e1bda10 abca1f9f76014feca126525710470286
msgid "Supported by: Plane (not Copter or Rover).Specifically QuadPlanes."
msgstr "支持载具：Plane（不支持 Copter / Rover）。具体为 QuadPlane。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2171
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2176
#: 56a23cf79b5c4887bd415c3a81fc012b 58b2529f2c484d468ac479a4dd3ffcc0
msgid ""
"Mission command to change to/from VTOL and fixed wing mode of flight. The "
"mode is changed based on the first parameter: 3 = change to VTOL flight, 4 ="
" change to fixed wing flight."
msgstr "任务命令，用于切换 VTOL 和固定翼飞行模式。模式根据第一个参数更改：3 = 切换到 VTOL 飞行，4 = 切换到固定翼飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1482
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1636
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2235
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2244
#: a721be7a6a24484883ddc222f8319813 a73b2cf0686c4466890084dd41c3c815
#: cbf796e4eb044adcb213931d2aed0d33 f305d114cdc6455188258dbe4359b1d0
msgid ""
"Points the :ref:`camera gimbal <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` at the \"region"
" of interest\"."
msgstr "将 :ref:`相机云台 <common-cameras-and-gimbals>` 指向「兴趣区域」（ROI）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2238
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2247
#: 2006cd5f81ad4720b906c799328f9313 3761a3766ab14a50b8c6135edb9f61d2
msgid ""
"After setting the ROI, the camera will continue to follow it until the end "
"of the mission, unless it is changed or cleared by setting another ROI. "
"Clearing the ROI is achieved by setting a later DO_SET_ROI command with all "
"zeros for ``param5``-``param7`` (Lat, Lon and Alt)."
msgstr ""
"设置 ROI 后，相机会一直跟随该 ROI 直到任务结束；除非通过设置新的 ROI 改变或清除。清除 ROI 的方法是发送一条 DO_SET_ROI "
"指令，将 ``param5``-``param7`` （Lat、Lon、Alt）全部置为 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2794
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2803
#: 40a8a117bcd84c47b5165f60d09f3294 eec60d20a8a34b1281466985de8f5276
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_INVERTED_FLIGHT"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_INVERTED_FLIGHT"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2798
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2807
#: 0b7e3dd4ca7f4d3dbe2bff58095d7e9c e8950819a08e48ae82539a0a05e69e11
msgid "Change between normal and :ref:`inverted flight <inverted-flight>`."
msgstr "在正常飞行和 :ref:`倒飞 <inverted-flight>` 之间切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2864
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2873
#: b56b22db898b44fcb6093d49608557bd ffb2a74c0f2242f1995916c605cd415a
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_AUTOTUNE_ENABLE"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_AUTOTUNE_ENABLE"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2868
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2877
#: 71eada3a917f4f419d39b48af1d7fd63 ee95fce38b8d4d4fa583034c72813d48
msgid "Enable/disable :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` mode."
msgstr "启用/禁用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2922
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2931
#: 657322c5800545b9ba72f0cdbdcc95ce 81393d7c393c47028657cc82e4791d5c
msgid "MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL"
msgstr "MAV_CMD_DO_ENGINE_CONTROL"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2926
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2935
#: 1bece13dc3224eb5b84ea0949c3c7703 23ee991173ed4538b43f2a183b972301
msgid "Stop or start the internal combustion engine (ICE)"
msgstr "停止或启动内燃机（ICE）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2928
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:2937
#: 9aae9cc7781b42ffa9a561d2ea43c6fb 9d7c7a56bbae447893eea2d07ea7050b
msgid ""
"This command can be used to start or stop the ICE before a NAV_VTOL_LAND or "
"after a NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF command for a QuadPlane to avoid potential prop "
"strikes in the wind. It should be placed before either of those "
"commands.Also can be used to allow a single engine start while disarmed if "
"otherwise prohibited by :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` bit 3 being set,"
msgstr ""
"此命令可用于在 NAV_VTOL_LAND 之前或 NAV_VTOL_TAKEOFF 命令之后为四旋翼飞机启动或停止 "
"ICE，以避免在风中潜在的螺旋桨碰撞。应将其放置在这些命令之前。也可用于在否则被 :ref:`ICE_OPTIONS<ICE_OPTIONS>` 第 3"
" 位禁止时允许在解锁状态下单次启动发动机。"

