msgid "Return to the *home location* and HOLD (non-boat) or LOITER (boat)."
msgstr "返回*原点*并执行 Hold（非船）或 Loiter（船）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:412
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:494
#: d704b0c496314e6984fdf934956ace73 e740491665bc4beda87d1269129cc3c8
msgid ""
"This command takes no parameters and generally should be the last command in"
" the mission. Without using this command, end of mission behavior is set by "
"the :ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"此命令不带任何参数，通常应作为任务中的最后一条命令。如不使用此命令，任务结束行为由 "
":ref:`MIS_DONE_BEHAVE<MIS_DONE_BEHAVE>` 参数设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1042
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1192
#: 2f9f92ae9bd54446a7917e4217be129d a6c1c830cde74ac2b6e5430a6300c362
msgid "Change the target horizontal speed and/or the vehicle's throttle."
msgstr "更改目标水平速度和/或车辆油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1485
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1639
#: 361e51fd496f42019259f284e9b6a40a c21af0bd180b48bd978f276599098444
msgid ""
"After setting the ROI, the camera will continue to follow it until the end "
"of the mission, unless it is changed or cleared by setting another ROI. "
"Clearing the ROI is achieved by setting a later DO_SET_ROI command with all "
"zeros for ``param5``-``param7`` (Lat, Lon, and Alt)."
msgstr ""
"设置 ROI 后，相机将持续跟踪该区域直到任务结束，除非通过设置另一个 ROI 来更改或清除。清除 ROI 的方法是将后续 DO_SET_ROI 命令的"
" ``param5``-``param7`` （纬度、经度和高度）均设置为零。"

