#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:311
#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:408
#: 8c6e21809b9d4ad8885cf6a912e21970 d56356dbf56246c5adee8f614e5a652a
msgid ""
"Fly/Drive to the specified location and then loiter there indefinitely — "
"where loiter means \"wait in place\" (rather than \"circle\"). If zero is "
"specified for a latitude/longitude/altitude parameter then the current "
"location value for the parameter will be used."
msgstr ""
"飞行/行驶到指定位置，然后在该处无限期留待（loiter）——这里的 loiter "
"意为“原地等待”（而非“绕圈”）。如果纬度/经度/高度参数指定为零，则该参数将使用当前位置的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:661
#: d9684c69ac134a01a5e7ded011f31dfe
msgid ""
"This is the mission equivalent of the :ref:`RTL flight mode <copter:rtl-"
"mode>`.  The vehicle will first climb to the :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` "
"parameter's specified altitude (default is 15m) before returning home."
msgstr ""
"这是与 :ref:`RTL 飞行模式 <copter:rtl-mode>` 等效的任务命令。飞行器会先爬升到 "
":ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` 参数指定的高度（默认为 15m），然后返航。"

